    "Cases for scripts/eval-enrich.mjs: the LLM suggestion step behind /api/word-enrich (lib/enrich.ts llmSuggest).",
    "prompt = the word the user looked up. expected.base = accepted lemmas (null = the model must answer null).",
    "expected.required = forms that must appear among the returned descriptions; each inner list is a set of alternatives, one suffices.",
    "expected.forbidden = forms that must NOT appear (invalid per REGELN.md, or belonging to a different verb). For null cases it holds the input itself.",
    "tags[0] = category, tags[1] = difficulty, tags[2] = where the gold comes from: regeln (REGELN.md), moderator (a moderator's verified decision on the board or in the changelog), control (basic dictionary knowledge).",
    "Gold is human-derived, never a model's output."
